# Everything is excluded by default; the Dockerfile opts in file by file.
# An allowlist is the only version of this that stays correct — a denylist
# silently ships whatever gets added to the repo next.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!data/embeddings/
!data/paths/
!data/markdown_files/trecho_diario.md

# Re-excluded inside the allowed paths.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
